WEBVTT

00:00.049 --> 00:04.970
This is a work of fiction.
Underage drinking is strongly prohibited and illegal.
Scenes involving alcohol with forceful consumption and shameful acts are not encouraged. Please view this as a comedy. Furthermore, all characters appearing in this work are of legal age.

00:07.097 --> 00:08.933
It's so hot!

00:09.099 --> 00:11.936
It's a tropical island!

00:12.102 --> 00:14.813
Aina... Everyone's looking at you.

00:14.980 --> 00:17.942
Oh... Sorry. But I'm probably--

00:18.108 --> 00:20.986
Cheers!

00:21.153 --> 00:23.489
Not as bad as those guys.

00:23.656 --> 00:25.908
We don't know them.

00:26.951 --> 00:30.704
Be passionate, my friends

00:30.913 --> 00:33.958
Shine bright with the sun

00:34.124 --> 00:37.503
Dive into the blue sky

00:37.711 --> 00:41.423
And let summer take it all

00:45.052 --> 00:48.055
GRAND BLUE DREAMING

00:55.688 --> 00:59.525
Be passionate, my friends

00:59.692 --> 01:02.778
Shine bright with the sun

01:02.945 --> 01:06.073
Dive into the blue sky

01:06.282 --> 01:10.327
And let summer take it all

01:10.494 --> 01:13.330
An expanding ocean of possibilities

01:13.497 --> 01:17.376
Summer is our amore

01:17.543 --> 01:21.046
We'll swear to the crystal clear sky

01:21.213 --> 01:24.174
Summer is in our hands

01:24.341 --> 01:28.262
Be passionate, my friends

01:28.429 --> 01:31.432
Shine bright with the sun

01:31.598 --> 01:34.893
Dive into the blue sky

01:35.102 --> 01:38.522
And let summer take it all

01:38.689 --> 01:42.693
With a cheerful heart

01:42.860 --> 01:45.696
Don't mess with me

01:45.863 --> 01:49.450
Keep going even if you fall

01:49.658 --> 01:53.078
And let summer take it all

01:57.166 --> 01:59.960
This is where we're staying for three nights.

02:00.127 --> 02:02.796
We're staying here?! It's so beautiful!

02:02.963 --> 02:05.424
- Yeah.
- We have to cook ourselves, though.

02:05.966 --> 02:07.718
There's even a pool, Kitahara!

02:07.885 --> 02:09.178
What did you say?!

02:10.179 --> 02:11.430
Don't be in such a hurry!

